OL,4,CPoundland founder says its time is     
OL,5,Climited                                
OL,6,GThe founder of Poundland Steve Smith   
OL,7,Ghas said the business will be "gone    
OL,8,Gforever" if a buyer is not found       
OL,9,Gbefore next week.                      
OL,11,FPoundland is continuing to trade on    
OL,12,Fthe high street as administrators seek 
OL,13,Fto sell it and its assets, but Smith - 
OL,14,Fno longer with the retailer - said     
OL,15,Fstores were receiving no new stock.    
OL,17,FHe warned: "There's going to be        
OL,18,Fnothing left on the shelves and if     
OL,19,F(the situation continues) beyond this  
OL,20,Fweekend there'd be nothing for the     
OL,21,Fbuyers to buy."                        
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
