OL,4,CMan guilty of murdering his ex-        
OL,5,Ccolleague                              
OL,6,GA man has been convicted of murder     
OL,7,Gafter fatally stabbing a former        
OL,8,Gcolleague in Birmingham.               
OL,10,FAhmad Alkozai was found guilty at      
OL,11,FBirmingham Crown Court on Thursday     
OL,12,Fafter attacking Muhammad Umair on      
OL,13,FWalford Road, Sparkbrook on 4 June.    
OL,15,FPolice said Alkozai had never          
OL,16,Fexplained why he stabbed Umair, but    
OL,17,Fthat he had tried to flee, before      
OL,18,Fbeing arrested in Bristol in the early 
OL,19,Fhours of the following morning.        
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
