OL,4,CHairless chimp Jambo among four apes   
OL,5,Cto die at zoo                          
OL,6,GA zoo has announced the death of one   
OL,7,Gof its most famous chimpanzees, as     
OL,8,Gwell as three bonobos who had become   
OL,9,Gunwell with a "flu-like respiratory    
OL,10,Gillness".                              
OL,12,FTwycross Zoo, on the Leicestershire-   
OL,13,FWarwickshire border, said members of   
OL,14,Fthe UK's only bonobo troop became      
OL,15,Funwell at the end of October and       
OL,16,Fdespite treatment, three "young        
OL,17,Fmembers" passed away.                  
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
